From 0bd1369e8f4c933c94df56aa8df4b0480317ff27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <3221756+christopherowen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 09:31:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(deepseek-v41): stage requested Engram rows from disk

Upstream base: 0f2a15c9277f34c9afe141cf578d1f02b3bebdfe

Rationale: Carry checkpoint file descriptors through the VL wrapper to bounded Engram row staging.
Quality and speed: Preserves native table values while avoiding full table residency.
Tests: source replay, syntax parse, and diff check; target hardware qualification pending.
Upstream status: local candidate, not submitted.
